evation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"Mary","lines":["There are some even stronger TRAINERS waiting for you.\nThe left is the DEFENSE ROOM, and the right is the RECOVERY ROOM.\nYour POKéMON's ATTACK power will be on trial either way."],"source_trainer":"TRAINER_MARY","battle":{"team":[{"species":301,"level":26}]}},{"at":[4,81],"source_script":"PetalburgCity_Gym_EventScript_Randall","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MAN_3","source_id":3,"local_id":3,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"Randall","lines":["Go on to the next room where a new challenge awaits you.\nAt the left is the CONFUSION ROOM.\nThe right door leads to the DEFENSE ROOM."],"source_trainer":"TRAINER_RANDALL","battle":{"team":[{"species":277,"level":26}]}},{"at":[4,42],"source_script":"PetalburgCity_Gym_EventScript_Parker","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MAN_3","source_id":4,"local_id":4,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"Parker","lines":["The next room is the STRENGTH ROOM. Can you withstand brute force?"],"source_trainer":"TRAINER_PARKER","battle":{"team":[{"species":327,"level":26}]}},{"at":[4,55],"source_script":"PetalburgCity_Gym_EventScript_Alexia","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_WOMAN_5","source_id":5,"local_id":5,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"Alexia","lines":["I think you've taught me a valuable lesson here.\nNow, go on! The left door goes to the STRENGTH ROOM.\nThe right door opens to the ONE-HIT KO ROOM.\nBoth of them have TRAINERS who are skilled at offense."],"source_trainer":"TRAINER_ALEXIA","battle":{"team":[{"species":40,"level":26}]}},{"at":[4,68],"source_script":"PetalburgCity_Gym_EventScript_George","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MAN_3","source_id":6,"local_id":6,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"George","lines":["I should have expected no less from our LEADER's kid.\nNo, wait! A TRAINER's abilities are earned only through effort.\nI lost because my own efforts weren't enough.\nGo on! The ONE-HIT KO ROOM is next."],"source_trainer":"TRAINER_GEORGE","battle":{"team":[{"species":287,"level":26}]}},{"at":[4,16],"source_script":"PetalburgCity_Gym_EventScript_Jody","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_WOMAN_5","source_id":7,"local_id":7,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"Jody","lines":["The way you use your POKéMON… It's like your father's style.\nGo on through! The GYM LEADER, your father, is waiting!"],"source_trainer":"TRAINER_JODY","battle":{"team":[{"species":335,"level":26}]}},{"at":[4,29],"source_script":"PetalburgCity_Gym_EventScript_Berke","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MAN_3","source_id":8,"local_id":8,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"Berke","lines":["Your father really is strong. He's a TRAINER worth my respect.\nAnd, I sense the same glow coming from you as your father.\nI hope that you'll stage a terrific battle with your father!"],"source_trainer":"TRAINER_BERKE","battle":{"team":[{"species":288,"level":26}]}},{"at":[3,109],"source_script":"PetalburgCity_Gym_EventScript_GymGuide","source_flag":"FLAG_HIDE_PETALBURG_GYM_GREETER","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MAN_2","source_id":9,"local_id":9,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":true,"name":"居民","lines":["Hey, how's it going, CHAMPION- bound 小悠?\nThe doors in this GYM open when you beat the awaiting TRAINERS.\nWhoops! The doors in this room are already open, so don't attack me!\nThe TRAINERS of PETALBURG GYM use all kinds of items.\nThe door at the